pcs2 (2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Updated CMake minimum version to 3.10 for CMake 4.x compatibility.
  * Replaced SDL with SDL2.
  * Replaced ilutGLBindTexImage with inline OpenGL calls (Debian libdevil
    omits ILUT OpenGL support).

